    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement by a Spellcaster)</em></p><p>A magical rune is etched into this small stone of multicolored quartz. When you finish a Long Rest, choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder: the rune is imbued with that damage type until you finish another Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Charges.</strong> The rune has 6 charges and regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn. When you cast a spell that deals damage, you can expend 1 charge to change the spell’s damage type to the rune’s damage type.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-obE2K4S1nRR9oHof\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Prismatic Shift</em> dépense la charge ; choisissez le type de la rune dans les dégâts du sort.</p></section>",
